# Dev shell for this repo — `nix develop` without typing it. See nix/README.md.
#
# With nix-direnv (NixOS: programs.direnv.nix-direnv.enable, on by default) the
# shell is cached and gets a GC root, so entering the directory is instant after
# the first build and the closure survives nix-collect-garbage. Without it this
# still works, it just re-evaluates the flake on every cd.
use flake

# nix-direnv reloads on flake.nix and flake.lock on its own. The dev shell also
# builds its interpreter from pkgs.kirocrew.dependencies, which lives in
# nix/kirocrew.nix, and that file is invisible to direnv's own change detection.
watch_file nix/kirocrew.nix nix/dashboard.nix
